  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "IMPORTANT: To restore compatibility with your projects, simply remove \"NullLoggerFactory.Instance\" from your calls to the Kducer constructor. We removed logging functionality and the dependency on Microsoft.Extensions.Logging.Abstractions.\n\t\tsupport for KDU-1A v41\n\t\tmisc new methods and minor corrections\n\t\tmaintains backwards compatibility with older KDU-1A software versions",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "Easily monitor and control a Kolver K-Ducer over ethernet",
